msgstr "Install Pi Agent?"

#: /home/igni/Downloads/debian/1.7-QuecPi-QCLinux-BL01/layers/meta-quectel/recipes-quectel/pi-agent-setup/files/pi-agent-setup.py
msgid ""
"Pi Agent 是一个在终端里工作的编程智能体：能读写文件、执行命令、帮你排查和修改"
"代码。它不是系统组件，会装在你自己的主目录里，随时可以删除。"
msgstr ""
"Pi Agent is a coding agent that lives in the terminal: it reads and writes "
"files, runs commands and helps you track down and fix code. It is not a "
"system component -- it installs into your own home directory and can be "
"deleted at any time."

#: /home/igni/Downloads/debian/1.7-QuecPi-QCLinux-BL01/layers/meta-quectel/recipes-quectel/pi-agent-setup/files/pi-agent-setup.py
msgid ""
"需要联网：向导会先检查网络，再下载 Node.js 运行时和 pi 本体（合计约 250 MB，"
"视网速需要几分钟）。"
msgstr ""
"Needs the network: the wizard checks connectivity first, then downloads the "
"Node.js runtime and pi itself (about 250 MB in total, a few minutes "
"depending on your connection)."

#: /home/igni/Downloads/debian/1.7-QuecPi-QCLinux-BL01/layers/meta-quectel/recipes-quectel/pi-agent-setup/files/pi-agent-setup.py
msgid "不需要管理员密码：全部装在你的主目录（~/.local），不修改系统文件"
msgstr ""
"No administrator password: everything goes into your home directory (~/."
"local) and no system file is touched"

#: /home/igni/Downloads/debian/1.7-QuecPi-QCLinux-BL01/layers/meta-quectel/recipes-quectel/pi-agent-setup/files/pi-agent-setup.py
msgid "随时可卸载：安装完成后会给出一条清理命令"
msgstr "Easy to remove: the last page gives you the one cleanup command"

#: /home/igni/Downloads/debian/1.7-QuecPi-QCLinux-BL01/layers/meta-quectel/recipes-quectel/pi-agent-setup/files/pi-agent-setup.py
msgid ""
"Pi Agent 本体由第三方（earendil-works）以 MIT 许可发布；本向导也同样以 MIT 许"
"可发布。"
msgstr ""
"Pi Agent itself is published by a third party (earendil-works) under the MIT "
"license; this wizard is released under the MIT license too."

